{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, עַד²","hw":"עַד²","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span></big></big><sub>35</sub><big></big>  <strong>prep.</strong> and <strong>conj. even to, until (</strong>BH III. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span>; so 𝔗 Syriac Old Aramaic Nab. Palm. Egyptian Aramaic (Lzb<sup>336</sup> S-C<sup>A 5 +</sup>)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>prep.:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  of space, <em>even to</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:13\" href=\"/Daniel.7.13\">Dn 7:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־כָּה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:28\" href=\"/Daniel.7.28\">28</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of amount, <em>up to</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:22\" href=\"/Ezra.7.22\">Ezr 7:22</a> <sup>(4 times)</sup>. <strong>c.</strong>  of time, <em>until</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:20\" href=\"/Daniel.2.20\">Dn 2:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:15\" href=\"/Daniel.6.15\">6:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:27\" href=\"/Daniel.6.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:18\" href=\"/Daniel.7.18\">7:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:26\" href=\"/Daniel.7.26\">26</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:24\" href=\"/Ezra.4.24\">Ezr 4:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:16\" href=\"/Ezra.5.16\">5:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וְעַד־כְּעַן</span>; = our <em>against</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:15\" href=\"/Ezra.6.15\">6:15</a> (cf. BH, p. 724 <sup>a</sup> top); <em>to</em> (the end of) = <em>during</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:8\" href=\"/Daniel.6.8\">Dn 6:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד יוֹמִין תְּלָתִין</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:12\" href=\"/Daniel.7.12\">7:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:25\" href=\"/Daniel.7.25\">25</a>. On <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־אָֽחֳרֵין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:5\" href=\"/Daniel.4.5\">Dn 4:5</a> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, אָחֳרָן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_אָחֳרָן\">אָחֳרָן</a>; and on <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־דִּבְרַת דִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:14\" href=\"/Daniel.4.14\">4:14</a> v. [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, דִּבְרָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_דִּבְרָה\">דִּבְרָה</a>].<br><strong>2.</strong>  conj.<em>:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־דִּי</span> <em>until</em>, sq. pf. (of past time) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:34\" href=\"/Daniel.2.34\">Dn 2:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:30\" href=\"/Daniel.4.30\">4:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:21\" href=\"/Daniel.5.21\">5:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:4\" href=\"/Daniel.7.4\">7:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:9\" href=\"/Daniel.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:11\" href=\"/Daniel.7.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:22\" href=\"/Daniel.7.22\">22</a>; sq. impf. (of fut.) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:9\" href=\"/Daniel.2.9\">2:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">4:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:22\" href=\"/Daniel.4.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:29\" href=\"/Daniel.4.29\">29</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:25\" href=\"/Daniel.6.25\">Dn 6:25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לָא מְטוֹ</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד דִּי שְׁלִטוּ וג׳</span> <em>up to the time that</em> …, i.e. <em>ere that</em>. <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span> alone, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:21\" href=\"/Ezra.4.21\">Ezr 4:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:5\" href=\"/Ezra.5.5\">5:5</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, עִדָּן","prev":"BDB Aramaic, עֲדָא"}